#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:2
msgid "Export channel data"
msgstr "채널 데이터 내보내기"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/ent-plus.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Enterprise and Enterprise Advanced plans"
" <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced 플랜"
" <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:7
msgid ""
"Ensure important data isn't trapped in silos by migrating data between "
"systems or backing data up for operational continuity. Once exported, "
"channel data can be analyzed using various tools for insights into team "
"dynamics, productivity, and communication patterns, and to fulfill "
"reporting and auditability requirements."
msgstr ""
"시스템 간에 데이터를 마이그레이션하거나 운영 연속성을 위해 데이터를 백업하여 "
"중요한 데이터가 사일로에 갇히지 않도록 하세요. 내보낸 채널 데이터는 다양한 "
"도구로 분석하여 팀 역학, 생산성, 커뮤니케이션 패턴에 대한 인사이트를 얻고 보고 "
"및 감사 가능성 요건을 충족하는 데 활용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:10
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:14
msgid ""
"For Mattermost Cloud deployments, no setup is required. See the `usage "
"<#usage>`__ section below for details on exporting channel data."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost Cloud 배포에서는 별도의 설정이 필요하지 않습니다. 채널 데이터 "
"내보내기에 관한 자세한 내용은 아래 `사용법 <#usage>`__ 섹션을 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:16
msgid ""
"For self-hosted deployments, a Mattermost system admin must install the "
"Channel Export integration from the in-product App Marketplace:"
msgstr ""
"셀프 호스팅 배포에서는 OKR.BEST 시스템 관리자가 제품 내 앱 마켓플레이스에서 "
"Channel Export 통합을 설치해야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:18
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, from the Product menu |product-list|, select **App "
"Marketplace**."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST에서 제품 메뉴 |product-list|\\ 에서 **앱 마켓플레이스**\\ 를 "
"선택합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:100
msgid ""
"Navigate between Channels, collaborative playbooks, and boards using the "
"product menu icon."
msgstr ""
"제품 메뉴 아이콘을 사용해 채널, 공동 플레이북, 보드 사이를 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:19
msgid "Search for or scroll to **Channel Export**, and select **Install**."
msgstr "**Channel Export**\\ 를 검색하거나 스크롤해 찾은 뒤 **설치**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:20
msgid "Once installed, select **Configure**. You're taken to the System Console."
msgstr "설치되면 **구성**\\ 을 선택합니다. 관리자 도구로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:21
msgid ""
"On the **Channel Export** configuration page, enable and configure the "
"plugin, and then select **Save**. You can restrict the ability to export "
"channels to system, team, and channel admins only, and you can configure "
"a maximum file size for channel export files."
msgstr ""
"**Channel Export** 구성 페이지에서 플러그인을 활성화하고 구성한 뒤 **저장**\\ 을 "
"선택합니다. 채널 내보내기 권한을 시스템·팀·채널 관리자로만 제한할 수 있으며, "
"채널 내보내기 파일의 최대 파일 크기를 구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:24
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "업그레이드"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:26
msgid ""
"We recommend upgrading this feature as new versions are released. "
"Generally, updates are seamless and don't interrupt the user experience "
"in Mattermost. Visit the `Releases page <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-channel-export/releases>`__ for the latest release, "
"available releases, and compatibiilty considerations."
msgstr ""
"새 버전이 출시되면 이 기능을 업그레이드하는 것을 권장합니다. 일반적으로 업데이트는 "
"매끄럽게 진행되며 OKR.BEST의 사용자 경험을 방해하지 않습니다. 최신 릴리스, 사용 "
"가능한 릴리스, 호환성 고려 사항은 `릴리스 페이지 <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-channel-export/releases>`__\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:29
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "사용법"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:31
msgid "You need to be a Mattermost system admin to export channel data."
msgstr "채널 데이터를 내보내려면 OKR.BEST 시스템 관리자여야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:33
msgid ""
"Use the ``/export`` slash command in a channel to export the current "
"channel's message data into a CSV-formatted file."
msgstr ""
"채널에서 ``/export`` 슬래시 명령어를 사용하면 현재 채널의 메시지 데이터를 CSV "
"형식 파일로 내보낼 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:36
msgid "Get help"
msgstr "도움 받기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:38
msgid ""
"Mattermost customers can open a `Mattermost support case "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_. To report a "
"bug, please open a GitHub issue against the `Mattermost Channel Export "
"plugin GitHub repository <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"plugin-channel-export>`_."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost 고객은 `Mattermost 지원 케이스 "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_\\ 를 열 수 있습니다. "
"버그를 신고하려면 `Mattermost Channel Export 플러그인 GitHub 저장소 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-channel-export>`_\\ 에 GitHub "
"이슈를 등록하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:40
msgid ""
"For questions, feedback, and assistance, join our pubic `Integrations and"
" Apps channel "
"<https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_ on the "
"`Mattermost Community Server <https://community.mattermost.com/>`_ for "
"assistance."
msgstr ""
"질문, 피드백, 도움이 필요하면 `Mattermost 커뮤니티 서버 "
"<https://community.mattermost.com/>`_\\ 의 공개 `Integrations and Apps 채널 "
"<https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_\\ 에 참여하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:43
msgid "Customize this integration"
msgstr "이 통합 사용자 정의"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/export-mattermost-channel-data.rst:45
msgid ""
"This plugin contains both a server and web app portion. See the `Channel "
"Export plugin README documentation <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-channel-export?tab=readme-ov-file#development>`_ on "
"GitHub for details. Visit the `Mattermost Developer Workflow "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/extend/plugins/developer-workflow/>`_ "
"and `Mattermost Developer environment setup "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/extend/plugins/developer-setup/>`_ for"
" information about developing, customizing, and extending Mattermost "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"이 플러그인은 서버 부분과 웹 앱 부분을 모두 포함합니다. 자세한 내용은 GitHub의 "
"`Channel Export 플러그인 README 문서 <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-channel-export?tab=readme-ov-file#development>`_\\ 를 "
"참고하세요. OKR.BEST 기능 개발·사용자 정의·확장에 관한 정보는 `Mattermost "
"Developer Workflow "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/extend/plugins/developer-workflow/>`_\\ 와 "
"`Mattermost Developer environment setup "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/extend/plugins/developer-setup/>`_\\ 를 "
"참고하세요."

